	(descr "Syntiant SPK0641HT4H-1 PDM MEMS microphone, TOP PORT (acoustic port dia 0.25 on the package top face - NO PCB hole required). Body 3.0 x 4.0 x 1.0mm. Land pattern from the datasheet, 2.75 x 3.75 overall: four inner pads 0.45x0.95 on a 0.85 x 1.35 grid, and four ground bars around them - 1.30x0.325 top and bottom, 0.325x2.30 left and right. Every pad-to-pad gap is 0.40. Pins: 1 DATA and 2 CLOCK are the left inner column (bottom, top), 3 SELECT and 4 Vdd the right inner column (top, bottom); the four bars 5-8 are all GROUND.")
